{
  "id": "math5-c2-s4-n61",
  "card_id": "math5-c2-s4-n61",
  "chapter": "第二章　有理数",
  "section": "§8. 圆周长和圆的面积",
  "number": "61",
  "title": "复习题",
  "printed_title": "61. 复习题",
  "start_page": 267,
  "start_printed": 258,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 53,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在式$\\frac{a}{b}$中，分数线表示除号，这种形式为$\\frac{a}{b}$的式子叫做分子为$a$、分母为$b$的分式。如$\\frac{7.2\\cdot5}{-2.5\\cdot3}$这样的式子就是分式。分子等于7.2和5的乘积，分母为$-2.5$和3的乘积。这些分式的运算可以和分数的运算一样来进行。例如，可以用2.5和3约分，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 258,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0267#12",
        "p0268#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{7.2\\cdot5}{-2.5\\cdot3}=\\frac{7.2\\cdot2}{-3}=\\frac{2.4\\cdot2}{-1}=-4.8$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 259,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0268#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "有时为了化简，可以把分式的分子和分母乘以同一个数。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 259,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0268#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，为了求$\\frac{3\\frac{1}{2}}{1\\frac{2}{3}}$的值，分子和分母同乘以6。得：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 259,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0268#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\frac{3\\frac{1}{2}}{1\\frac{2}{3}}=\\frac{3\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot6}{1\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot6}=\\frac{21}{10}=2.1$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 259,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0268#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "求16.04和$\\frac{3}{4}$的积：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 259,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0268#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$16.04\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{16.04}{1}\\cdot\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{16.04\\cdot3}{4}=4.01\\cdot3=12.03$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 259,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0268#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "求3.63和$\\frac{3}{5}$的商：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 259,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0268#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$3.63:\\frac{3}{5}=3.63\\cdot\\frac{5}{3}=\\frac{3.63\\cdot5}{3}=1.21\\cdot5=6.05$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 259,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0268#9"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
